":"_t","target":"总体分析"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"1ffce96c12798d38a68de41b5ef64d4385570a9bc008ba935d1f15f4fb85e2cf","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"5a2cc83ecfce1a7b6a69544ffdbe4866e69b25a99f2e78d79cde3c8fc94d0883","logical_entry_identity":"60a212de414d5f6a47bf9db3306a79e7cc6eb3fda2e86bace26214f8592708c9","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"A farportal is a way to travel incredible distances in the blink of an eye. They usually require an external item to use. You have no idea if it is even two-way.\nThis one seems to go near the town of Last Hope in Maj'Eyal.","source_tag":"_t","target":"远行传送门能让人眨眼间跨越难以想象的距离。它们通常需要借助外部物品才能使用。你甚至不知道它是否能双向通行。\n这座传送门似乎通往马基·埃亚尔最后的希望城附近。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"57519e8bc87ee52b670a1c473f6442b2c82c412fd138361b4530b326b306419e","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"5a2d55df559cc5b2a3fa3a12e4f21500f0c3d316f2927f8919bc23a621d3a535","logical_entry_identity":"ec1a741bd401f4daff8c18df493bd6706115eb603470ccc6d0faa3f9eafa7a4a","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"shocking touch","source_tag":"_t","target":"电击之触"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"43b9409722fec3812ac35de57f9938b37b31a4ba92a7ce861fc94416e282088f","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"5a538a94cb8f9733bfcb6f1574ba686ea47b3d94a241b4a128fcd4a901ffaea0","logical_entry_identity":"7988ae62e030026340b8a011d31c3704c13649db20f5a5ed28cc40bb693deefc","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"When your life dips below 50%% of your total life an automated process turns some of your lower skin layers (or other internal organs) into a thick metallic layer for 6 turns.\n\t\tWhile the effect lasts all damage done to you is reduced by a flat amount equal to 100%% of your Constitution.\n\t\tThis effect can only trigger once every %d turns.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"当你的生命值降到总生命值的 50%% 以下时，一个自动程序会将你的部分深层皮肤（或其他内部器官）转化成厚实的金属层，持续 6 回合。\n\t\t效果持续期间，你受到的所有伤害都会减少一个固定值，数值等于体质的 100%%。\n\t\t该效果最多每 %d 回合触发一次。"},{"args_order":null,"call_